Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

findNewImporter [SimTalk]
Registers the Exporter designated by <Path> as being available with its Broker.
Remarks
The Broker then searches the list of all open requests and attempts to find new Exporters. The fact that the
Exporter is available to fulfill new orders is passed along to all Brokers connected by Connectors.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.findNewImporter
Example
MyExporter.findNewImporter
See also
Importers [Exporter]
Importers [Worker]
findNewImporter [SimTalk]
